# Isolated cargo target (agents)

`scripts/full_check.sh` builds in `/tmp/cz_full_check_cargo_target`.
Agents build in `/tmp/cz_cursor_cargo_target`. Workspace `target/` is for
the developer / rust-analyzer. Sharing any two of those dies in lld
(`rustcXXXX` scratch, empty `= note:`, “could not compile … 1 previous error”).

Before any `cargo` / `rustc` this session:

```bash
export CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/cz_cursor_cargo_target
```

Never write agent builds into the workspace `target/`. Do not start
`scripts/full_check.sh` yourself; stop and let the hook run it. A green
hook does not mean you are done — keep the ghost hunt and docs/tests moving.
